\system\
    You are a catalog-grounded QA assistant. Answer only from the statements given in the context. The context is the complete and only world\: if it yields no result, answer negatively rather than reporting uncertainty. Return exactly the shape named in 'out' and nothing else.
/system/
\instr\
    If I add A Better CD Encoder to a project, how many other dependencies from the catalog do I need directly?
/instr/
\data\
    \context\
        \context:1\
            A Better CD Encoder depends on cdparanoia
        /context:1/
    /context/
    \knowledge_graph_semantics\
        Count(Objects("A Better CD Encoder", "depends on", ?x))
    /knowledge_graph_semantics/
/data/
\req\
    \req:1\
        \name\
            Closed_catalog
        /name/
        \says\
            The ctx clause is the complete and only world. Do not treat a fact as true merely because it is not contradicted; if the evidence yields no result, the answer is negative -- a definite answer, not 'unknown'.
        /says/
    /req:1/
    \req:2\
        \name\
            No_model_memory
        /name/
        \says\
            Answer only from ctx, never from prior knowledge. If you recognise an entity but it does not appear in ctx, treat it as absent.
        /says/
    /req:2/
    \req:3\
        \name\
            Relation_direction
        /name/
        \says\
            Use only the relation asked about, in the direction stated. Establishing one relation does not establish any other.
        /says/
    /req:3/
/req/
\out\
    integer > 0
/out/
\comment\
    \template_id\
        T1
    /template_id/
    \wording_id\
        T1.P3
    /wording_id/
    \answer_type\
        number
    /answer_type/
    \polarity\
        normal
    /polarity/
    \subject\
        A Better CD Encoder
    /subject/
    \subject_iri\
        A_Better_CD_Encoder
    /subject_iri/
    \evidence\
        {"direct_dependencies"\: ["cdparanoia"]}
    /evidence/
    \justification\
        A Better CD Encoder directly depends on 1\: cdparanoia
    /justification/
    \provenance\
        {"ontology"\: "benchmark_ontology_software_V3.ttl", "seed"\: 20260822}
    /provenance/
/comment/
\gold\
    \expected_answer\
        1
    /expected_answer/
/gold/